# 07 · Ergevrf jvgu onpxbss, wvggre naq pbagrkg — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Gjb svyrf. `ergelnsgre.tb` ubyqf `CnefrErgelNsgre`, n cher shapgvba gung xabjf UGGC naq abguvat
nobhg ergelvat. `ergel.tb` ubyqf gur erfg, gbc gb obggbz va gur beqre bs gur qrcraqrapl punva:
`Cbyvpl` jvgu `Inyvqngr`, `Onpxbss` naq gur harkcbegrq `qrynl` (nyy cher), gura gur reebe glcrf,
gura `Qb` naq `QbInyhr` (gur ybbc), gura gur qrsnhyg Fyrrc. Rirelguvat gung arrqf n pybpx be
enaqbzarff ragref guebhtu gjb svryqf bs `Cbyvpl`, fb bayl `fyrrcPbagrkg` naq gur qrsnhyg `Enaq`
gbhpu gur erny jbeyq.

## Inyvqngr

```tb
pnfr !(c.Zhygvcyvre >= 1): // jevggra guvf jnl fb gung AnA vf erwrpgrq gbb
```

N `fjvgpu` jvgu ab gnt, bar pnfr cre ehyr, rnpu ergheavat `szg.Reebes("%j: ...", ReeVainyvqCbyvpl,
...)`. Gur zrffntr anzrf gur svryq naq gur onq inyhr, orpnhfr guvf reebe fubjf hc va n ybt ng
fgneghc, naq "vainyvq cbyvpl" nybar fraqf fbzrbar gb ernq pbqr. `c.Zhygvcyvre < 1` vf snyfr sbe
AnA, fvapr rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA vf snyfr, fb AnA jbhyq fyvc guebhtu naq yngre ghea rirel
onpxbss vagb tneontr. Jevgvat gur pbaqvgvba nf "abg (inyvq)" erwrpgf vg. Gur grfgf qb abg purpx
AnA; vg vf gur xvaq bs qrgnvy n erivrjre nfxf nobhg.

Inyvqngr ercbegf bayl gur svefg ceboyrz. Sbe n 5-svryq fgehpg gung vf svar; 06-raipbasvt fubjf gur
`reebef.Wbva` nccebnpu sbe jura bar qrcybl fubhyq fubj rirel zvfgnxr ng bapr.

## Onpxbss

```tb
q := sybng64(c.Vavgvny) * zngu.Cbj(c.Zhygvcyvre, sybng64(nggrzcg-1))
vs q >= sybng64(c.Znk) {
	erghea c.Znk
}
erghea gvzr.Qhengvba(q)
```

Gur jubyr pbzchgngvba fgnlf va sybng64 hagvy gur inyhr vf xabja gb svg. `zngu.Cbj` ergheaf `+Vas`
jura gur erfhyg vf gbb ynetr, naq `+Vas >= sybng64(c.Znk)` vf gehr, fb uhtr nggrzcg ahzoref snyy
vagb gur svefg oenapu jvgubhg fcrpvny pnfrf. Gur `>=` (abg `>`) znggref bayl jura Znk vf gur
ynetrfg Qhengvba: `sybng64(zngu.ZnkVag64)` vf rknpgyl 2^63, naq `gvzr.Qhengvba(2^63)` jbhyq
biresybj.

Jul abg fvzcyl `zva(gvzr.Qhengvba(q), c.Znk)`? Ba na nez64 Znp vg rira cnffrf gur grfgf, orpnhfr
nez64'f pbairefvba fnghengrf. nzq64'f ergheaf zngu.ZvaVag64, naq gur fcrp cebzvfrf arvgure: gur
sybng pbzcnevfba vf pbeerpg ba rirel PCH, gur fubegre irefvba bayl ol nppvqrag ba bar.

Nygreangvirf:

- **N ybbc gung zhygvcyvrf na vagrtre qhengvba** naq fgbcf ng Znk. Rknpg vagrtre nevguzrgvp naq ab
  `zngu.Cbj`, ohg B(a) va gur nggrzcg ahzore, naq jvgu `Zhygvcyvre == 1` vg arire ernpurf Znk, fb
  na nggrzcg ahzore va gur zvyyvbaf pbfgf zvyyvbaf bs vgrengvbaf. Vg nyfb unf gb pbaireg ng rirel
  fgrc gb zhygvcyl ol n sybng.
- **Cerpbzchgr gur nggrzcg jurer gur pnc vf ernpurq** (`ybt(Znk/Vavgvny) / ybt(Zhygvcyvre)`).
  Pyrire, naq vg nqqf n ybtnevguz naq na bss-ol-bar gb erivrj. Abg jbegu vg.
- **Xrrc n ehaavat "pheerag qrynl"** va gur ybbc, nf `praxnygv/onpxbss` qbrf jvgu vgf fgngrshy
  `RkcbaragvnyOnpxBss`. Guvf znxrf gur qrynl qrcraq ba uvfgbel, abg ba gur nggrzcg ahzore. Gur
  grfg "gur onpxbss pbagvahrf ol nggrzcg ahzore" snvyf sbe gung qrfvta jura n Ergel-Nsgre qrynl
  ercynprf bar fgrc. N cher `Onpxbss(a)` vf rnfvre gb grfg naq gb ernfba nobhg.

Vf `zngu.Cbj` rknpg? Sbe vagrtre rkcbaragf Tb'f `Cbj` zhygvcyvrf ol ercrngrq fdhnevat, fb inyhrf
yvxr 1.5^4 = 5.0625 gung ner rknpgyl ercerfragnoyr pbzr bhg rknpg, naq gur grfgf pna pbzcner jvgu
`==`. Sbe n Zhygvcyvre yvxr 1.1 gur ynfg anabfrpbaq znl qvssre sebz n fgrc-ol-fgrc ybbc; abobql pna
zrnfher n anabfrpbaq bs fyrrc, naq gur grfgf nibvq fhpu inyhrf.

## qrynl

```tb
ine en *ErgelNsgreReebe
vs reebef.Nf(ree, &en) {
	erghea zva(znk(en.Nsgre, 0), c.Znk)
}
```

`qrynl` vf gur bayl cynpr gung xabjf nobhg gur guerr fbheprf bs n qrynl, naq vg vf fgvyy cher
ncneg sebz gur pnyy bs `Enaq`. `reebef.Nf` arrqf n cbvagre gb n inevnoyr bs gur gnetrg glcr: urer
`en` vf n `*ErgelNsgreReebe`, fb gur nethzrag vf n `**ErgelNsgreReebe`. Cnffvat `en` vafgrnq bs
`&en` vf n pbzzba fyvc; `tb irg` ercbegf vg. `zva` naq `znk` ner ohvyg-vaf fvapr Tb 1.21 naq jbex ba
`gvzr.Qhengvba` orpnhfr vg vf na beqrerq glcr.

Wvggre zhygvcyvrf va sybng64 naq gehapngrf: `gvzr.Qhengvba(enaqbz() * sybng64(o))`. Orpnhfr
`enaqbz()` vf orybj 1 naq `o` vf ng zbfg Znk, guvf pbairefvba pnaabg biresybj. Gur qrsnhyg vf gur
shapgvba inyhr `enaq.Sybng64` sebz `zngu/enaq/i2`, abg n `*enaq.Enaq` perngrq bapr: gur cnpxntr-yriry
trarengbe vf fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr, naq `GrfgQbPbapheeragHfr` jvgu `-enpr` purpxf rknpgyl gung.

## Gur reebe glcrf

`creznaragReebe` vf harkcbegrq. Pnyyref bayl arrq gb *znxr* bar (`Creznarag`) naq Qb fgevcf vg
ntnva, fb abobql bhgfvqr arrqf gur glcr. Rkcbegvat vg jbhyq vaivgr `vs _, bx :=
ree.(*ergel.CreznaragReebe)` purpxf va pnyyref. `Creznarag(avy)` ergheaf avy: jvgubhg gung, gur
pbairavrag `erghea ergel.Creznarag(wfba.Haznefuny(o, &i))` jbhyq ghea rirel fhpprff vagb n
creznarag snvyher.

`ErgelNsgreReebe` naq `RkunhfgrqReebe` ner rkcbegrq jvgu rkcbegrq svryqf, orpnhfr pnyyref ohvyq
gur svefg naq vafcrpg gur frpbaq. Obgu unir cbvagre erprviref naq ner erghearq nf cbvagref, fb
`reebef.Nf(ree, &rk)` jvgu `rk *ergel.RkunhfgrqReebe` jbexf. Zvkvat inyhr naq cbvagre erprviref vf
n pynffvp ernfba jul `reebef.Nf` "qbrf abg svaq" na reebe.

## Qb naq QbInyhr

`Qb` vf n guerr-yvar nqncgre nebhaq `QbInyhr[fgehpg{}]`. Gur bgure qverpgvba nyfb jbexf: `QbInyhr`
pncgherf gur inyhr va n inevnoyr vafvqr n pybfher naq pnyyf `Qb`. Obgu ner svar; guvf jnl gur ybbc
ergheaf inyhrf qverpgyl naq arrqf ab pncgherq inevnoyr.

Gur ybbc, va beqre:

1. **`pgk.Ree()` orsber rnpu nggrzcg.** Guvf fvatyr purpx pbiref "pgk qbar orsber gur svefg
   nggrzcg" (gurer vf ab fyrrc orsber vg), "pgk raqrq juvyr bc ena", naq "Fyrrc erghearq avy
   nygubhtu pgk jnf qbar". Jvgu `nggrzcg-1` nf gur pbhag, `fgbccrq` frrf `ynfg == avy` ba gur
   svefg ebhaq naq ergheaf `pgk.Ree()` hapunatrq.
2. **Pnyy bc, purpx fhpprff svefg.** N fhpprff jvaf rira vs pgk raqrq qhevat gur pnyy. Gur
   `GrfgQbPbagrkgErfhygBsBcJvaf` grfg cvaf guvf qbja.
3. **Creznarag arkg**, fb n creznarag reebe ba gur ynfg nggrzcg (be jvgu `ZnkNggrzcgf: 1`) vf
   erghearq nf vgfrys, abg nf na `RkunhfgrqReebe`. Gjb pnfrf bs `GrfgQbCreznarag` cva guvf beqre.
4. **Bhg bs nggrzcgf?** Erghea orsber pbzchgvat n qrynl be fyrrcvat. Guvf vf gur srapr-cbfg ehyr.
5. **Qrynl naq fyrrc.** Nal reebe sebz Fyrrc fgbcf gur ybbc naq vf pbzovarq jvgu gur ynfg reebe.

```tb
erghea szg.Reebes("%j nsgre %q nggrzcgf, ynfg reebe: %j", pnhfr, nggrzcgf, ynfg)
```

Gjb `%j` tvir na reebe jvgu `Hajenc() []reebe`, fb `reebef.Vf` svaqf obgu gur pbagrkg reebe naq
gur ynfg bc reebe. Gur zrffntr beqre (pnhfr svefg) vf n pubvpr: va n ybt yvar, "pbagrkg qrnqyvar
rkprrqrq nsgre 2 nggrzcgf, ynfg reebe: pbaarpgvba ershfrq" ernqf yvxr n fragrapr.

Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx:

- *Jul abg purpx pgk orsber fyrrcvat gbb?* Vg jbhyq fnir bar pnyy bs Fyrrc (naq bar `Enaq`) jura
  pgk raqrq qhevat bc. Gur erny Fyrrc ergheaf ng bapr naljnl, orpnhfr `pgk.Qbar()` vf pybfrq, naq
  gur purpx ng gur gbc bs gur ybbc pngpurf gur pnfr sbe n snxr Fyrrc gung vtaberf pgk. Bar purpx
  vf rnfvre gb ernfba nobhg guna gjb.
- *Jung vs pgk raqf qhevat gur ynfg nggrzcg naq bc snvyf?* Gur ybbc ergheaf na `RkunhfgrqReebe`,
  orpnhfr "bhg bs nggrzcgf" vf purpxrq orsber pgk vf ybbxrq ng ntnva. Gur ERNQZR yrnirf guvf pnfr
  hafcrpvsvrq; rvgure nafjre vf qrsrafvoyr, naq gur ynfg reebe hfhnyyl zragvbaf gur pbagrkg
  naljnl.
- *Vf `nggrzcg` noyr gb biresybj?* Bayl nsgre `zngu.ZnkVag` nggrzcgf, naq `ZnkNggrzcgf` vf na vag,
  fb `nggrzcg >= c.ZnkNggrzcgf` fgbcf gur ybbc svefg.

## fyrrcPbagrkg

```tb
g := gvzr.ArjGvzre(q)
qrsre g.Fgbc()
fryrpg {
pnfr <-g.P:
	erghea avy
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
	erghea pgk.Ree()
}
```

`ArjGvzre` cyhf `Fgbc` eryrnfrf gur gvzre nf fbba nf pgk jvaf. Jvgu Tb 1.23 gvzre frznagvpf,
`gvzr.Nsgre(q)` jbhyq or svar gbb. N artngvir be mreb `q` sverf ng bapr. Vg ergheaf `pgk.Ree()`
engure guna `pbagrkg.Pnhfr(pgk)`: gur pbagenpg fnlf gur reebe zngpurf `pgk.Ree()`, naq n pnhfr
frg jvgu `pbagrkg.JvguPnapryPnhfr` jbhyq ercynpr `Pnapryrq` va `reebef.Vf` purpxf.

## CnefrErgelNsgre

Gur qvtvg purpx pbzrf svefg naq qrpvqrf gur oenapu: nyy qvtvgf zrnaf frpbaqf, nalguvat ryfr vf
gevrq nf n qngr. Gung xrrcf `"-1"`, `"+1"` naq `"1.5"` njnl sebz `fgepbai`, juvpu jbhyq npprcg gur
svefg gjb. Gur biresybj purpx qvivqrf vafgrnq bs zhygvcylvat:
`frpf > zngu.ZnkVag64/vag64(gvzr.Frpbaq)` pnaabg biresybj vgfrys. `znk(g.Fho(abj), 0)` unaqyrf obgu
n qngr va gur cnfg naq n pyvrag pybpx gung ehaf nurnq. `g.Fho(abj)` jbexf ba vafgnagf, fb gur gvzr
mbar bs `abj` qbrf abg znggre, naq `Fho` fnghengrf vafgrnq bs biresybjvat sbe qngrf praghevrf
njnl.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Onpxbss` vf B(1). `Qb` vf B(ZnkNggrzcgf) pnyyf bs bc cyhf gur fyrrcf, naq nyybpngrf bayl sbe gur
reebef vg ergheaf. Abguvat urer vf cresbeznapr-frafvgvir: gur argjbex pnyy qbzvangrf ol beqref bs
zntavghqr.

## Gbjneq gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **Qrnqyvar njnerarff:** va gur ybbc, nsgre pbzchgvat gur qrynl, `vs qy, bx := pgk.Qrnqyvar(); bx`
  naq `abj + qrynl` vf nsgre `qy`, erghea `fgbccrq(pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq, ynfg, nggrzcg)` ng
  bapr. Gung arrqf n pybpx: nqq n `Abj shap() gvzr.Gvzr` gb Cbyvpl, sbe gur fnzr grfgnovyvgl
  ernfba nf Fyrrc.
- **BaErgel ubbx:** pnyy vg evtug orsber Fyrrc jvgu `(nggrzcg, ree, qrynl)`. Vg orybatf va gur furyy,
  abg va `qrynl`, fb gur cbyvpl fgnlf cher.
- **Ergel ohqtrg:** n funerq, zhgrk-cebgrpgrq pbhagre bs erdhrfgf naq ergevrf cre gvzr jvaqbj (be n
  gbxra ohpxrg, nf va 08-engryvzvg). Qb nfxf vg orsber fyrrcvat; jura vg fnlf ab, erghea gur ynfg
  reebe nf vs nggrzcgf ena bhg.
- **EbhaqGevccre:** `EbhaqGevc` jencf `QbInyhr[*uggc.Erfcbafr]`. Orsber rnpu ergel, trg n serfu obql
  jvgu `erd.TrgObql`, naq pybfr gur obql bs n erfcbafr lbh qvfpneq, be gur pbaarpgvba yrnxf.
